WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:02.544
SOCHIL MARTIN: We need
 to do something about it.

00:00:02.627 --> 00:00:04.087
It's dangerous for us now.

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:06.548
SPEAKER: There are chunks
of my childhood.

00:00:06.631 --> 00:00:08.091
Black holes, black spaces.

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.969
I asked her,
"How far back does this go?"

00:00:11.052 --> 00:00:14.431
And she said,
"It goes all the way back."

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.182
♪ (SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:20.520
MARTIN: La Luz del Mundo
 is a church founded in 1926.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.355
Anywhere, you name it,

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:24.190
there's a Church of
The Light of the World.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:28.445
La Luz del Mundo claims to have
five million members
in 57 countries.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:31.156
One of the largest
religious cults of our time.

00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:33.450
MARTIN: In addition to
 the yachts and the cars,

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:36.578
they have ranches
in Texas and California.

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:38.788
The church has one leader
at a time.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.290
And that's the apostle.

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:43.042
There have been three apostles
in the same family.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:47.380
With three generations of abuse
that have been covered up
till now.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:50.175
I wanted to prove
that I was worthy.

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:51.968
MARTIN: They almost
 make it seem romantic.

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:53.136
Like a fairytale.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.512
You're gonna be a princess.

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:56.723
He hit me until I fell.

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:59.100
SPEAKER 2:

00:00:59.184 --> 00:01:00.560
SPEAKER 3:
You might think it's a sin,

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:03.980
but it's not because it's
in the presence of the apostle.

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:07.484
They cut ties with your family.

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:10.236
My mother,
she doesn't talk to me.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.030
(SPEAKING SPANISH)

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:16.451
SPEAKER 4:

00:01:16.534 --> 00:01:19.913
SPEAKER 3: The reason why
I want to remain anonymous
is the fear.

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:23.082
MARTIN: If something happens
 to me, my daughter,
 or my husband,

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:24.083
it's coming from them.

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:25.168
This isn't a church.

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:28.087
This is some sort of mafia.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.757
SPEAKER 5: The first thing
 we think is exposure.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:31.674
We gotta expose it.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.135
MARTIN: I started to reach out
to people in the United States.

00:01:34.344 --> 00:01:35.929
Everybody in the MeToo movement.

00:01:36.012 --> 00:01:37.722
Never got anything back
from anybody.

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:40.683
SPEAKER 5: The Bible says,
 "Maintain justice
 and do what is right."

00:01:41.017 --> 00:01:42.477
This has to stop.

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.604
I think that
this would have been different

00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:47.106
if these were
white, American girls.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:48.483
We need to get justice.

00:01:48.566 --> 00:01:49.818
MARTIN: They have so much power.

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:50.944
SPEAKER 5: It got bigger.

00:01:51.027 --> 00:01:53.238
Everybody exposing this beast.

00:01:53.321 --> 00:01:55.532
SPEAKER 6: (SPEAKING SPANISH)

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:56.991
The truth is there.

00:01:57.075 --> 00:01:58.034
(SPEAKING SPANISH)

00:01:58.243 --> 00:01:59.744
I forgive myself.

00:01:59.994 --> 00:02:01.287
It was never a blessing.

00:02:01.871 --> 00:02:04.874
I want to be a voice
for all the other little girls.

